					</p>
					<div class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">
						Streetwear Label, United States
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- About SDF Clothing Section -->
	<section id="about" class="py-20 px-4">
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-12 text-center">
				Why SDF Clothing is Bangladesh's Most Trusted Clothing Manufacturer
			</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
				<div>
					<p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						SDF Clothing manufactures premium apparel for fashion brands, retailers, and startups across the EU, UK, US, and Australia.
					</p>
					<p class="text-gray-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
						As a full-package apparel manufacturer, we manage the complete supply chain: fabric sourcing for woven and knitwear constructions, dyeing, finishing, cut and sew production, embroidery, screen printing, AQL inspection, and FOB delivery to your port. Whether you need OEM, private label, or custom apparel, we deliver to your exact specifications.
